   "w": 1400,
   "h": 894,
   "text": "It is night in the woods. Most animals go to sleep at night. But some animals are just waking up.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    1.38,
    11.4
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "image": "books/G1/100/p05.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 894,
   "text": "I go for a walk in the woods with Dad. We look and listen for animals that come out at night. Look at the moon. It is very bright. The moonlight will help us see the animals.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    12.6,
    25.56
   ]
  },
